  "id": "subsec-the-set-of-real-numbers-9",
  "level": "2",
  "url": "sec-the-real-number-system.html#subsec-the-set-of-real-numbers-9",
  "type": "Checkpoint",
  "number": "2.1.71",
  "title": "",
  "body": "     Simplify complicated fraction    <p>Simplify as much as possible the following number: \\(\\displaystyle \\frac{{@aa@}+{@bb@}-{@cc@}}{{@dd@}+{@ee@}-{@bb@}}\\)<\/p> <p>[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]][[feedback:prt1]]<\/p>    <h3>Worked Solution<\/h3> <p>To simplify \\( \\displaystyle \\frac{{@aa@}+{@bb@}-{@cc@}}{{@dd@}+{@ee@}-{@bb@}}\\)<\/p> <p>We simplify the numerator first by operating on \\({@aa@}+{@bb@}-{@cc@}={@sol_1@}\\)<\/p> <p>Simplify the denominator \\({@dd@}+{@ee@}-{@bb@}={@sol_2@}\\)<\/p> <p>Diving the result of the numerator and denominator, we have<\/p> <p>\\( \\begin{align} \\displaystyle \\frac{{@aa@}+{@bb@}-{@cc@}}{{@dd@}+{@ee@}-{@bb@}} & = \\displaystyle \\frac{{@sol_1@}}{{@sol_2@}}\\\\ &= \\displaystyle {@ta@} \\end{align} \\)<\/p>   1  0.1  0    2025073100    aa:rand(4)+2; bb:rand(10)+6\/8; cc:rand(4)+aa; dd:rand(30)+10\/12; ee:rand(14)+8\/6; \/*solution*\/ sol_1:aa+bb-cc; sol_2:dd+ee-bb; ta:sol_1\/sol_2;       <p>Evaluate \\(\\frac{{@aa@}+{@bb@}-{@cc@}}{{@dd@}+{@ee@}-{@bb@}}\\)<\/p> <p>{@ta@}<\/p>      1  0  0   <span style=\"font-size: 1.5em; color:green;\"><i class=\"fa fa-check\"><\/i><\/span> Correct answer, well done.    <span style=\"font-size: 1.5em; color:orange;\"><i class=\"fa fa-adjust\"><\/i><\/span> Your answer is partially correct.    <span style=\"font-size: 1.5em; color:red;\"><i class=\"fa fa-times\"><\/i><\/span> Incorrect answer.   .  *10  none  1  i  cos-1  lang  [  0    ans1  algebraic  ta  10  1  0   0    1  0  0  1  3     prt1  1.0000000  1  1      0   AlgEquiv  ans1  ta   0  =  1   -1  prt1-1-T     =  0   -1  prt1-1-F       224814912  1622231901  48945777  1808930778  692898261  1320030898  1851781083  1697685622  286434030  1269108785  300276303  1843893148  1352592930  271202070  217375176  1773180785  1012038762  1856813924  1114175044  1431004045  1534002884  837694040  637350561  22541145  1026936991  73730026  1753121790  809604017  276805627  913799639  1065770688  346789844  1578501807  1454829202  699449602  434431958  60182992  1182737983  1245800101  1163565233  4157665  1346147441  2120469473  147176740  1476664313  1079416100  467595893  246479151  1769559750  77002980   1    ans1  ta    prt1  1.0000000  0.0000000  prt1-1-T        Add review   "
