  "body": "     Composition of Functions    <p>Given the following two functions,<\/p> <p style=\"margin-left: 30px\">\\(f(x)={@fx@}\\) <br>\\(g(x)={@gx@}\\)<\/p> <p>Determine the composition \\(f(g(x))\\).<\/p> <p style=\"margin-left: 30px\">\\( f(g(x)) = \\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]<\/p> <p>[[feedback:prt1]]<\/p>    <h3>Worked Solution<\/h3> <p>To find \\(f(g(x))\\) we need to apply the function \\(f(x)\\) to the function \\(g(x)\\). We compute the following,<\/p> <p style=\"margin-left: 30px\">\\(\\begin{align*} f(g(x)) &= f({@gx@}) \\\\ &= {@aa*(x^2+cc)+bb@} \\\\ &= {@ta1@} \\end{align*}\\)<\/p>   1  0.1  0    2023060500    aa:rand(4)+2; pm1:rand_with_prohib(-1,1,[0]); bb:pm1*(rand(8)+1); fx:aa*x+bb; pm2:rand_with_prohib(-1,1,[0]); cc:pm2*(rand(4)+1); gx:x^2+cc; ta1:expand(ev(fx,x=gx)); incorr_comp_order:expand(ev(gx,x=fx));       <p>\\(f(x) = {@fx@}\\) <br>\\(g(x) = {@gx@}\\) <br>\\(f(g(x)) = {@ta1@}\\)<\/p>      1  0  0   <span style=\"font-size: 1.5em; color:green;\"><i class=\"fa fa-check\"><\/i><\/span> Correct answer, well done.    <span style=\"font-size: 1.5em; color:orange;\"><i class=\"fa fa-adjust\"><\/i><\/span> Your answer is partially correct.    <span style=\"font-size: 1.5em; color:red;\"><i class=\"fa fa-times\"><\/i><\/span> Incorrect answer.   .  *10  none  1  i  cos-1  lang  [  0    ans1  algebraic  ta1  10  1  0   0    1  0  0  1  3     prt1  1.0000000  1  1      0   AlgEquiv  ans1  ta1   0  =  1   -1  prt1-1-T     =  0   1  prt1-1-F       1   AlgEquiv  ans1  incorr_comp_order   0  +  0   -1  prt1-2-T   <p>You have computed the function \\(g(f(x))\\). <br>Take care with the order in which you apply the functions in the composition.<\/p>   -  0   -1  prt1-2-F       3556340  1815329883  1136353422  2084863717  1853557674  1847878784  1877701699  1035811904  1547827146  211571835  2133775280  197046438  110269217  1086159124  1746070762  248218954  1031729113  372238492  2107960605  373057455  626991301  1790487852  1072898085  551916043  912776710  1427356498  1861290257  1658631256  122076496  1244292697   1    ans1  ta1    prt1  1.0000000  0.0000000  prt1-1-T     2    ans1  incorr_comp_order    prt1  0.0000000   prt1-2-T        Add review   "
