  "body": "     Finding Inverses of a linear Functions    <p>Find the inverse of the function below<\/p> <p>\\( \\displaystyle f(x)={@func@}\\)<\/p> <p><b>Note:<\/b> \\(\\ln\\) can be typed as <code> log<\/code><\/p> <p>Leave your answer in exact form<\/p> <p>\\(f^{-1}(x)=\\)[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]][[feedback:prt1]]<\/p> <p><\/p>    <h3>Worked Solution<\/h3> <p>\\(\\begin{align} \\displaystyle f(x)&={@func@}\\\\ y&={@func@}\\\\ &{@sol2@}\\\\ &{@sol3@}\\\\ &{@sol4@}\\\\ \\end{align}\\)<\/p> <p>Swap \\(x\\) and \\(y\\) to write the inverse function<\/p> <p>\\(f^{-1}(x)= \\displaystyle{@ta1@}\\)<\/p> <p><\/p>   1  0.1  0    2023060500    \/*finding inverses*\/ const_a:rand(8)+2; const_b:-(rand(4)+4); func:%e^(const_a*x+const_b); \/*worked solution*\/ sol1:y=func; sol2:log(y)=const_a*x+const_b; sol3:log(y)-const_b=const_a*x; sol4:x=(log(y)-const_b)\/const_a; ta1:(log(x)-const_b)\/const_a;       <p>\\( \\displaystyle f(x)={@func@}\\)<\/p> <p>\\(f^{-1}(x)=\\displaystyle {@ta1@}\\)<\/p>    <p id=\"author\">Mary Sayuni<\/p><p> <\/p><p id=\"concept\">https:\/\/docs.google.com\/document\/d\/1SHRuavwMgYyW58e67mna9MuZFOHpXMe7aPVGGcDpRYo\/edit<\/p> <p id=\"reviewer\">Nixson Kiplagat<\/p> <p id=\"reviewer\">Santiago Borio<\/p> <p id=\"description\">This question requires the student to find the inverse of the given function. <\/p>   1  0  0   <span style=\"font-size: 1.5em; color:green;\"><i class=\"fa fa-check\"><\/i><\/span> Correct answer, well done.    <span style=\"font-size: 1.5em; color:orange;\"><i class=\"fa fa-adjust\"><\/i><\/span> Your answer is partially correct.    <span style=\"font-size: 1.5em; color:red;\"><i class=\"fa fa-times\"><\/i><\/span> Incorrect answer.   .  *10  none  1  i  cos-1  lang  [  0    ans1  algebraic  ta1  10  1  0   0    1  0  0  1  3     prt1  1.0000000  1  1      0  checks for the correct answer  AlgEquiv  ans1  ta1   0  =  1   -1  prt1-1-T     =  0   -1  prt1-1-F       418351871  801770541  1517882779  1986015763  643631541  1847036485  1128792134  1548142766  1953032235  592073621  545276761  1791464062  1680619677  833735968  276543476  405238742  692725985  1891896939  185227961   1    ans1  ta1    prt1  1.0000000  0.0000000  prt1-1-T        Add review   "
