  "type": "Checkpoint",
  "number": "4.3.11",
  "title": "",
  "body": "     Parabola 4 (Master quiz)    <p>Find the focus and directrix of the parabola \\( (c): {@parabola@} \\)<\/p> <br> 1. a) Rewrite the parabola (c) in the form \\(X^{2} = 4 p Y\\). <br> \\( \\quad \\) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]] <br> 2. We recall that in general, \\((c): (x-x_{0})^{2}= 4 p (y - y_{0}) \\) has focus \\(F(x_{0}, y_{0}+p)\\) and directrix \\((l): y = y_{0}-p\\) . <br> Find the focus and directrix of the parabola (c). <br> Focus: \\( F\\) ([[input:ans2]], [[input:ans3]]) [[feedback:prtA]] <br> \\( \\qquad \\qquad \\) [[validation:ans2]] \\(\\qquad\\) [[validation:ans3]] <br> Directrix \\((l):\\) [[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]] [[feedback:prt4]]    <br><b>Worked solution<\/b> <br> 1. a) Rewrite the parabola (c) in the form \\(X^{2} = 4 p Y\\). <br> \\( (c): {@parabola@} \\) <br>\\( \\begin{array}{rc} \\Leftrightarrow & ({@expr1@})+({@expr2@})= 0 \\\\ \\Leftrightarrow &{@(x-aa)^2@}+({@expr2@})= 0 \\\\ \\Leftrightarrow & {@(x-aa)^2@}=({@ev(-expr2,simp)@}) \\\\ \\Leftrightarrow & {@(x-aa)^2@}= 4 \\cdot ({@pp@})({@y-cc@}) \\end{array} \\) <br> So, \\( X = {@x-aa@}\\), \\(p={@pp@} \\) and \\( Y = {@y-cc@} \\). <br> 2. Find the focus and directrix of the parabola (c). <br>In general, \\((c): (x-x_{0})^{2}= 4 p (y - y_{0}) \\) has focus \\(F(x_{0}, y_{0}+p)\\) and directrix \\((l): y = y_{0}-p\\) <br> It follows that \\(y_{0} = {@cc@} \\), \\( x_{0}= {@aa@} \\) and \\(p={@pp@}\\). <br> Therefore, Focus: \\(F({@aa@},{@cc+pp@}) \\equiv ({@aa@},{@ev(cc+pp,simp)@}) \\) and directrix \\( (l): y = {@cc-pp@}= {@ev(cc-pp,simp)@}\\)   1  0.1  0    2022071300    \/*Defining parabola equation*\/ aa: rand_with_step(-5,5,1); \/*value of y0*\/ pp: rand_with_step(-4,4,1); \/*value of pp*\/ cc: rand_with_step(-5,5,1); \/*value of x0*\/ parabola: expand((x-aa)^2-4*pp*(y-cc))=0; \/*Coordinates of the focus*\/ ta2: aa; \/*abscissa*\/ ta3: cc+pp; \/*ordinate*\/ \/*Directrix*\/ ta4: y=cc-pp; \/*Worked solution*\/ expr1: expand((x-aa)^2); expr2: expand((x-aa)^2-4*pp*(y-cc))-expr1; simp:false; ta1: (x-aa)^2=4*pp*(y-cc);       <p>Find the focus and directrix of the parabola \\( (c): {@parabola@} \\)<\/p> <br> 1. a) Rewrite the parabola (c) in the form \\(X^{2} = 4 p Y\\). {@ta1@} <br> 2. We recall that in general, \\((c): (x-x_{0})^{2}= 4 p (y - y_{0}) \\) has focus \\(F(x_{0}, y_{0}+p)\\) and directrix \\((l): y = y_{0}-p\\) . <br> Find the focus and directrix of the parabola (c). <br> Focus: \\( F\\) ({@ta2@}, {@ta2@}) and Directrix \\((l):{@ta4@}\\)      1  0  0   <span style=\"font-size: 1.5em; color:green;\"><i class=\"fa fa-check\"><\/i><\/span> Correct answer, well done.    <span style=\"font-size: 1.5em; color:orange;\"><i class=\"fa fa-adjust\"><\/i><\/span> Your answer is partially correct.    <span style=\"font-size: 1.5em; color:red;\"><i class=\"fa fa-times\"><\/i><\/span> Incorrect answer.   .  *10  dot  1  i  cos-1  lang  [  0    ans1  algebraic  ta1  15  1  0   0    1  0  0  1  3     ans2  algebraic  ta2  5  1  0   0    1  0  0  1  3     ans3  algebraic  ta3  5  1  0   0    1  0  0  1  3     ans4  algebraic  ta4  10  1  0   0    1  0  0  1  3     prt1  1.0000000  1  1      0   AlgEquiv  ans1  ta1   0  =  1   -1  prt1-1-T     =  0   -1  prt1-1-F        prt4  1.0000000  1  1   \/*Node1: Check correct answer*\/ \/*Node 2: Mistake using variable y*\/ mistake: y=cc-pp;    0   AlgEquiv  ans4  ta4   0  =  1   -1  prt4-1-T     =  0   1  prt4-1-F       1   AlgEquiv  ans4  mistake   0  =  0   -1  prt4-2-T   You used the variable \\(x\\) instead of \\(y\\).   -  0   -1  prt4-2-F        prtA  1.0000000  1  1      0   AlgEquiv  ans2  ta2   0  =  1   1  prtA-1-T     =  0   1  prtA-1-F       1   AlgEquiv  ans3  ta3   0  +  1   -1  prtA-2-T     -  0   -1  prtA-2-F   <br>From question 1, we have \\((c): {@parab_red@} \\), which is equivalent to the form \\((y-y_{0})^{2}= 4 p (x - x_{0}) \\). <br>Clearly, \\(x_{0} = {@cc@} \\), \\( y_{0}= {@aa@} \\) and \\(p={@pp@}\\), so \\(F({@cc+pp@},{@aa@})\\).     1222775824  700626544  1230792454  186212981  499388504  710130059  371183404  1632229513  1906672308  1419387980  1644232012  460609709  1284311712  817646269  225993831  1423340221  65732808  1441019926  1758547042  1116550132  2072769899  776980929  1426493720  72664686  797383933  333075072  1718338073  1628649772  2015412284  186220703  2056807266  110325692  399522759  717492974  1574440335  1450226168  222324360  123779997  153633148  365785406  1737056824  2137067873  177357620  1204914365  457237036  384828753  2144974111  1291571134  801833767  952257952  476257489  1867639424  289624210  1919732792  2124409666  242965975  1121966607  1714821784  512132039  1002358759  675177757  1573435668  1548960068  802870376  598908547  1236215564  1992498532  896619439  1479255272  1046574642  930242160  283775718  1720302633  1750782614  741240943  626312326  1490391182  1410029008  1074353343  310383491  1058493698  1655810676  2080090879  193427186  2014815088  529495157  1178490611  277019598  1079698518  1628946030  978326112  784220267  991195286  926196698  1475149933  1354459798  415364424  2049831530  1529394727  1393411128      Add review   "
